// Split from a log; the base crafting material.
//
// max_stack and durability are tuning, not structure: change them here,
// no recompile (REQUIREMENTS.md #3). An item declaring durability must
// declare max_stack: 1 -- the registry rejects the combination, because
// ItemStack's invariant makes a stack of two worn tools unbuildable.
ItemDef(
    name:       "cubara:plank",
    max_stack:  64,
    durability: None,
    // Wood is the fuel (PHASE2_ARCHITECTURE.md 7). No coal exists.
    // One plank smelts one ingot (200 ticks); a log is four planks and
    // two planks make four sticks, so the three agree. The owner's call:
    // it was ten planks an ingot, which read as the furnace not working.
    burn_ticks: Some(200),
)
